  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 泰勒公式建立了函数与各阶导数的联系，由题设条件容易想到利用函数的二阶泰勒公式."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "用拉格朗日型余项的泰勒公式，有"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "f (x + 1) = f (x) + f ^ {\\prime} (x) + \\frac {1}{2} f ^ {\\prime \\prime} (x) + \\frac {1}{6} f ^ {\\prime \\prime \\prime} (x + \\xi (x)), (0 <   \\xi <   1);\\tag{①}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "f (x - 1) = f (x) - f ^ {\\prime} (x) + \\frac {1}{2} f ^ {\\prime \\prime} (x) - \\frac {1}{6} f ^ {\\prime \\prime \\prime} (x - \\eta (x)), (0 <   \\eta <   1).\\tag{②}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "①±②式，并整理得③，④式："
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "f ^ {\\prime \\prime} (x) = f (x + 1) - 2 f (x) + f (x - 1) - \\frac {1}{6} f ^ {\\prime \\prime \\prime} (x + \\xi (x)) + \\frac {1}{6} f ^ {\\prime \\prime \\prime} (x - \\eta (x)),\\tag{③}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "2 f ^ {\\prime} (x) = f (x + 1) - f (x - 1) - \\frac {1}{6} f ^ {m} (x + \\xi (x)) - \\frac {1}{6} f ^ {m} (x - \\eta (x)).\\tag{④}"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$\\lim_{\\xi \\to \\infty} f'(\\xi) = \\lim_{x \\to \\infty}[f(x + 1) - f(x)] = C - C = 0$ ，得 $\\lim_{x \\to \\infty} f'(x) = 0.$",
